+    // (after a crash or an iOS memory kill), which would otherwise hold up new uploads to the same
+    // host. Download tasks share the session and are left alone. Resolves how many it cancelled.
+    AsyncFunction("cancelBackgroundUploadTasks") { (promise: Promise) in
